---
---

<section class="border-b border-[#232730] bg-[#090a0c] py-20 lg:py-24" id="usage">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
        Deployment Targets
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        Write your feature slices once in C#. Compile them to WebAssembly for Cloudflare edge isolates, or to Native AOT for serverless functions and containers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- Target 1 -->
      <div class="rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Target 01</div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Cloudflare Workers</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Compiled to WebAssembly via NetWasm. Runs inside Cloudflare Workers with sub-2ms isolate execution, D1 relational SQLite, R2 storage, and Workers AI inference.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1a1d24]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-400">Runtime: NetWasm 0.1 / Edge</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Target 2 -->
      <div class="rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Target 02</div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">AWS Lambda</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Compiled with .NET Native AOT into a standalone 12MB ELF binary. Deploys to custom runtime environments with sub-15ms cold starts and 20MB of memory usage.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1a1d24]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-400">Runtime: Linux AOT (provided.al2023)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Target 3 -->
      <div class="rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Target 03</div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Docker & VPS</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Packages into an 18MB distroless container that boots in 5ms. Serves 10,000+ requests per second on a single VPS core with PostgreSQL or SQLite.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1a1d24]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-400">Runtime: Distroless Linux Container</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Target 4 -->
      <div class="rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Target 04</div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Frontend Monorepo</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Hosts C# backends alongside TanStack Start, Next.js, or Expo. Autonomous contract generation outputs typed clients and Standard Schema validators into the workspace.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1a1d24]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-400">Surface: @reptar/client & RPC</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Performance & Engineering Standards -->
    <div class="mt-12 rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 lg:p-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-emerald-400">
            Edge Performance Standard
          </h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            Measured directly on Cloudflare edge: in-memory Wasm execution runs in under 2ms per request (<code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">server-timing: reptar;dur=0.0</code>). Relational queries against D1 execute with zero runtime reflection, keeping latency bounded strictly by network roundtrips.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 shrink-0">
          <a
            href="https://reptar-docs.rocktown-labs.workers.dev"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-950 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors rounded"
          >
            Review Benchmarks & Specs
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
